      "story_intro": "秋风的请柬落在泉庭时，边沿已经染红：它请村庄去枫林赴一场『收获之试』——赢下双廓的枫火，一年的粮仓就许给树篱。艾吉带上春夏两季赢来的灯赴约，请柬在ta背上烫得像刚出炉的面包。",
      "story_intro_en": "The autumn invitation landed on the spring yard with its rim already blushing: it summoned the village to the maple woods for a Trial of Harvest — win the twin maple-fire galleries, and a year's granary is pledged to the hedges. Eggy set out bearing the lamps won through spring and summer; on its back the invitation glowed hot as fresh-baked bread.",
      "story_outro": "枫火在两条廓上熄成金色的余烬。秋收之灵把第一把栗子抛进蛋窝——请柬的下一页，写着『月满团扇』。",
      "story_outro_en": "The maple fires cooled to golden embers along both galleries. The harvest spirit tossed the first chestnut into the egg's nest — the invitation's next page read: Under the Full-Moon Fan."
    },
