      "story_intro": "栗树的卫队不许任何人空手穿过果园：壳里藏甲，甲上带刺，双径各列一队长墙。秋收之灵站在树顶宣布规矩——卫队的墙若被塔阵打穿一个缺口，栗子才肯落地。艾吉数了数弹道，决定打两个。",
      "story_intro_en": "The chestnut guard lets no one cross the orchard empty-handed: shells hide armor, armor wears thorns, and a wall-file stands on each lane. The harvest spirit decreed from the crown: only when the turret line punches at least one gap through the guard's wall will the chestnuts fall. Eggy counted the firing lanes — and chose to punch two.",
      "story_outro": "两堵栗墙几乎同时开花，果园下起一场痛快的栗子雨。卫队行军礼放行：团扇月已在第三道门后升起。",
      "story_outro_en": "Both burr-walls burst almost at once and the orchard rain of chestnuts came down in earnest. The guard saluted and gave way: beyond the third door the full-moon fan had already risen."
    },
