      "story_intro": "月亮升到果园中央时，团扇之灵从三径各起一支舞队：召唤者领旋、护盾者殿后，月色把塔影拉成三条长的拍子。秋考的不是力气而是节奏——艾吉把塔位落在鼓点上。",
      "story_intro_en": "When the moon rose over the orchard's heart, the Fan Spirit set a dance troupe marching down each of three roads: summoners leading the turning, shields bringing up the rear, the moonlight stretching turret-shadows into three long beats. The autumn test was rhythm, not brute force — and Eggy planted the towers on the drumbeats.",
      "story_outro": "三队舞在破晓前谢幕，扇面般的月亮缓缓收拢。鼓声未歇，西风里已经带来雁阵的呼哨。",
      "story_outro_en": "The three troupes took their bows before dawn and the fan-shaped moon slowly folded. The drums had not yet died when the west wind carried the wild geese's whistle."
    },
