      "story_intro": "秋之守灵把考题写上天空：雁团领风，三径同过，塔必须在看不见地面的长空里排出阵来。西风把地面吹成背景，艾吉仰头良久——然后把对空的枪口连成一架斜飞的雁字。",
      "story_intro_en": "The autumn warden wrote its exam across the sky: goose-formation leading the wind, all three roads crossed at once, and the towers must array themselves in a long air with no ground in sight. The west wind smeared the earth into background. Eggy looked up for a long while — then joined the anti-air muzzles into a slanted geese-script of their own.",
      "story_outro": "雁阵在最后一径上方折了一个漂亮的队形，向南去了。长空落满枫笺，写着同一句：秋实之夜，明晚开席。",
      "story_outro_en": "Above the last road the geese folded into a flawless wheel and turned south. The sky came down with maple-leaf letters all saying one line: the Harvest Night banquet — tomorrow dusk."
    },
