      "story_intro": "秋实之夜，四季的影子第一次同桌：夏潮未散的浪、春雷余响的云、长夜留下的星，被秋风一一请上三条旧路。它们不为复战而来，只为验一验——村庄把丰收握在爪子里时，还认不认得防守的姿势。三尊丰年之影各踏一径，冠冕摆在蛋边。",
      "story_intro_en": "On the Night of Fallen Harvest the four seasons sat at one table for the first time: summer's still-brewing surf, spring thunder's echoing clouds, the long night's leftover stars — autumn invited each down one of the three old roads. Not for a rematch, but to see whether a village drunk on plenty still remembers how to defend. Three harvest shades, one per road; the crown laid beside the egg.",
      "story_outro": "冠冕在黎明前自己戴到了艾吉头上。四季的影子回到各自的季节里去，只在席上留下一枚冬天的果核——它凉得像一句还没说完的话。",
      "story_outro_en": "Before dawn the crown placed itself on Eggy's head. The season-shades went home into their own seasons, leaving only one winter stone on the banquet cloth — cold as a sentence not yet finished."
